        "id": "KhazixQ",
        "name": "Taste Their Fear",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Deals physical damage to the target. Damage increased on <font color='#FFF673'>Isolated</font> targets. If he chooses to <font color='#00DD33'>Evolve Reaper Claws</font>, this refunds a percent of it's cooldown against <font color='#FFF673'>Isolated</font> targets. Kha'Zix also gains increased range on his basic attacks and Taste Their Fear.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kha'Zix slashes a nearby enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/105/130/155/180 + (105% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. This deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(168/220.5/273/325.5/378 + (220.5% bonus Attack Damage)) damage</span> instead to enemies <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Isolated</span> from their allies.",
